A recognized opener in a body needs no blank line above it

```
[^n]: intro
  > quote
  # heading

see[^n]
.
<p>see<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>intro</p>
      <blockquote><p>quote</p></blockquote>
      <h1 id="heading">heading</h1>
      <p><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
:: term
:  intro
   > quote
   # heading
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>intro</p>
    <blockquote><p>quote</p></blockquote>
    <h1 id="heading">heading</h1>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
- intro
  > quote
  # heading
.
<ul>
  <li>intro
    <blockquote><p>quote</p></blockquote>
    <h1 id="heading">heading</h1>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
[^n]: intro
  > quote
    ordinary line

see[^n]
.
<p>see<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>intro</p>
      <blockquote><p>quote
ordinary line</p></blockquote>
      <p><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
[^n]: intro
  > quote
  # heading
  - item

see[^n]
.
<p>see<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>intro</p>
      <blockquote><p>quote</p></blockquote>
      <h1 id="heading">heading</h1>
      <ul>
        <li>item</li>
      </ul>
      <p><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
intro
   # heading
.
<p>intro
# heading</p>
```

```
:: term
:  definition
 > quote
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>definition</dd>
</dl>
<p>&gt; quote</p>
```

```
- intro

  :: term
  :  definition
   > quote
.
<ul>
  <li>intro
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
      <dd>definition</dd>
    </dl>
    <blockquote><p>quote</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
[^n]: intro

   :: term
   :  definition
    > quote

see[^n]
.
<p>see<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>intro</p>
      <dl>
        <dt>term</dt>
        <dd>definition</dd>
      </dl>
      <p>&gt; quote<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```
